$$
L=\frac{m_1}2|\dot r_1|^2+\frac{m_2}2|\dot r_2|^2
-\frac{k_1}2(\rho_1-\ell)^2-\frac{k_2}2(\rho_2-\ell)^2
-m_1gy_1-m_2gy_2.
